# PDF delivery index

This ignored directory is the stable handoff entry point for current recruiter-facing
PDF copies. New application bundles live only under `applications/<application-id>/`.
Retired layouts belong under `archive/applications/outputs/`, never directly below
`output/pdf/`.
The application manifest under `meta/applications/<application-id>/` records the selected
Pack and exact artifact hashes; delivery copies are never factual input for later drafting.

Versioned Golden Pack artifact sets belong under
`golden-packs/<version>/`. Keep prior iterations in the private archive rather than
cluttering the active delivery directory.

List current unsent bundles here with relative links. When a portal accepts one file,
use the recommended combined application; otherwise attach the separate CV, Portfolio,
and cover letter as supported by the vacancy portal.
